   "params": [],
   "data": {
    "text": "NOVA: MUTABLE MODULES\n\nFive Mutable Instruments\nmodules that Audible\nInstruments does not have:\n\nDUAL TRIGGER   Peaks\nMACRO OSC 2    Plaits,\n               24 models\nCHIPTUNE OSC   Edges\nDUAL FILTER    Blades\nTEXTURE SYNTH 2  Beads\n\nIt plays by itself. Try the\ntwo buttons at the top of\nMACRO OSC 2: they step\nthrough the models."
   }
  },
